      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 12 · AI Content Repurposer\nTakes a blog post or transcript and repurposes it into a newsletter, LinkedIn post, X thread, short-video script and quote cards.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/content-repurposer` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"title\": \"5 lessons from automating our sales ops\",\n \"content\": \"Paste the full blog post or transcript here...\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
